WEBVTT

00:00:59.542 --> 00:01:03.244
efficient transportation
from Brazil to China;

00:01:03.902 --> 00:01:09.482
thriving ecosystems through
protection and restoration;

00:01:09.506 --> 00:01:13.872
reducing waste and reclaiming its value;

00:01:13.896 --> 00:01:18.449
growing food in good ways
that regenerates soil;

00:01:19.066 --> 00:01:23.875
shifting diets to less meat, more plants;

00:01:24.426 --> 00:01:27.804
and equity for women and girls.

00:01:28.524 --> 00:01:32.029
Gender and climate
are inextricably linked.